Nothing Phone (3) LineageOS device tree

This repository combines original device integration with material originating
from or interoperating with other projects. The root LICENSE applies only where
no more specific license or notice is present.

- Android Open Source Project and LineageOS material retains its original
  Apache-2.0 or other applicable license.
- Linux kernel interfaces, headers, and modules retain their applicable GPL and
  Linux syscall-note terms.
- `kernel/gki/` contains documented Google GKI build artifacts. Their build IDs,
  provenance, and purpose are recorded in `kernel/gki/README.md`.
- `prebuilt/kernel-headers.tar.gz` contains kernel-derived headers required by
  the Android build. It is retained pending conversion to reproducible source
  exports.
- Proprietary Android userspace files are not redistributed. Builders extract
  them from firmware they own by using `proprietary-files.txt` and the extraction
  scripts.
- Two stock GPL NFC modules lacking matching published source are not
  redistributed. Their expected hashes and local extraction process are recorded
  in `kernel/prebuilt-modules/README.md`.
- Product names and trademarks belong to their respective owners. This project
  is not affiliated with or endorsed by Nothing or LineageOS.

Redistributors are responsible for complying with every applicable license,
including corresponding-source requirements. Please report provenance or license
concerns through the process in SECURITY.md.
